#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:740
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_TheyCallMeTrickMaster"
msgid ""
"Behold!\p"
"For I am the greatest living mystery\n"
"of a man in all of HOENN!\l"
"They call me…\p"
"The TRICK MASTER!\n"
"Wahahaha! Glad to meet you!$"
msgstr ""
"看好了！\p"
"我就是全丰缘地区最神秘的男人！\n"
"人们都叫我……\p"
"机关大王！哇哈哈哈！很高兴认识你！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:748
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_ComeToChallengeTrickHouse"
msgid ""
"You, you've come to challenge\n"
"my TRICK HOUSE, haven't you?\p"
"That's why you're here, isn't it?\n"
"Yes, it is!\p"
"Consider your challenge accepted!\p"
"Enter through the scroll there,\n"
"and let your challenge commence!\p"
"I shall be waiting in the back!$"
msgstr ""
"你、你是来挑战我的机关屋的吧？\p"
"你就是为了这个来的，\n"
"对不对？没错，就是这样！\p"
"我接受你的挑战！\p"
"从那边的挂轴进去，开始你的挑战吧！\p"
"我会在最里面等着你！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:758
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_ItsAScroll"
msgid "It's a scroll.$"
msgstr "是一幅挂轴。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:761
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_GoInHoleBehindScroll"
msgid ""
"There is a big hole behind the scroll!\p"
"Want to go in?$"
msgstr ""
"挂轴后面有一个大洞！\p"
"要进去吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:765
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_LeavingOnJourneyNote"
msgid ""
"There is a note affixed to the scroll…\p"
"“I am leaving on a journey.\n"
"Don't look for me. TRICK MASTER”$"
msgstr ""
"挂轴上贴着一张纸条……\p"
"“我去旅行了。不要来找我。\n"
"机关大王”$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:770
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_NextTimeUseThisTrick"
msgid ""
"For the next time, I'll use this trick,\n"
"and that scheme, and those ruses…\p"
"Mufufufu… If I may say so, it's\n"
"brilliantly difficult, even for me!$"
msgstr ""
"下一次，我要用这个机关、\n"
"那个计谋，还有那些花招……\p"
"呣呼呼呼……虽然是我自己说的，\n"
"但就连我都觉得难得精彩！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:776
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_InMidstOfDevisingNewChallenges"
msgid ""
"Hah? What?!\n"
"Oh, it's you!\p"
"I'm in the midst of devising new tricky\n"
"challenges!\p"
"It's not too much to ask for a bit more\n"
"time for me to think, is it now?\l"
"You wouldn't begrudge me that?\l"
"Come back in a little while!$"
msgstr ""
"哈？什么？！哦，是你啊！\p"
"我正在设计新的机关挑战呢！\p"
"再给我一点时间想一想，\n"
"这要求不算过分吧？你不会连这都\l"
"不肯吧？过一会儿再来吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:786
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_YoureHereToAcceptReward"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's you! You're here to accept the\n"
"reward from before, isn't that right?\l"
"Yes, right I am!\p"
"Here!\n"
"I'll give it to you now!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，是你！你是来领之前的奖励的吧？\n"
"没错，我说对了！\p"
"给！我现在就给你！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:793
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_DidYouNotComeToClaimReward"
msgid ""
"Hah?\n"
"Did you not come to claim your reward?$"
msgstr "哈？你不是来领奖励的吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:797
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_MechadollWhichTent"
msgid ""
"MECHADOLL 5 I AM!\n"
"IF REWARD IS NOT TAKEN BY YOU,\l"
"THEN TRICK MASTER YOU CANNOT FOLLOW.\p"
"RED TENT OR BLUE TENT,\n"
"WHICH DO YOU PREFER?$"
msgstr ""
"机关人偶5号，就是我！\n"
"奖励你若不拿，机关大王你便追不上。\p"
"红色帐篷还是蓝色帐篷，你喜欢哪个？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:804
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_ThenFarewell"
msgid "THEN FAREWELL.$"
msgstr "那么，再会。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:807
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_PCFullAgain"
msgid ""
"YOUR PC STATUS: FULL AGAIN.\n"
"MEAN, YOU ARE.$"
msgstr "你的电脑状态：又满了。你，真坏。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:811
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle_Text_FoundAScroll"
msgid "{PLAYER} found a scroll.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}找到了一幅卷轴。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:814
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle_Text_MemorizedSecretCode"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} memorized the secret code\n"
"written on the scroll.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}记住了卷轴上写着的暗号。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:818
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle_Text_SecretCodeWrittenOnIt"
msgid "A secret code is written on it.$"
msgstr "上面写着暗号。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHouseEntrance/scripts.inc:821
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHouseEntrance_Text_DoorLockedWriteSecretCodeHere"
msgid ""
"The door is locked.\p"
"…On closer inspection, this is written\n"
"on it: “Write the secret code here.”$"
msgstr ""
"门锁着。\p"
"……仔细一看，上面写着：\n"
"“请在这里写下暗号。”$"
